## Running with Docker

```bash
docker compose up --build
```

The API is then available at http://localhost:8000, with interactive
documentation at http://localhost:8000/docs.

## Running locally

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
cp .env.example .env
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

